                    <description>&lt;p&gt;sanity-lnet test_205: Failed cleanup.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Memory leak detected, with the following log:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class="code panel" style="border-width: 1px;"&gt;&lt;div class="codeContent panelContent"&gt;
